WEBVTT

00:02:28.853 --> 00:02:31.606
after spending four months
in dugout canoes

00:02:31.647 --> 00:02:34.734
from the sources to the Okavango
delta in Botswana,

00:02:34.775 --> 00:02:36.444
it meant it trusted me.

00:02:36.485 --> 00:02:39.614
And if it did, so could they,
the Luchaze people.

00:02:40.198 --> 00:02:44.285
But see, most Luchaze children
do not know of the Mukissi

00:02:44.327 --> 00:02:46.204
or any other local tale.

00:02:46.579 --> 00:02:50.875
And that is because the 40-plus
year-long war they have endured

00:02:50.917 --> 00:02:53.628
has created a gap in storytelling

00:02:53.669 --> 00:02:57.131
and has stripped away ownership
of their heritage.

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:00.843
So now the ancient wisdom,